## Status

Skeleton only — no product code yet. The build happens through the orchestration harness:
issues in, reviewed PRs out.

## Development

```bash
uv sync
uv run pytest
uv run ruff check .
uv run mypy
```

These are the verification commands the orchestration adapter declares, so the harness's
test and review stages shell out to exactly this list. Keep them green and keep them
accurate — a command that is configured but checks nothing is a quality gate that silently
passes forever.

## Orchestration

The project adapter lives in `.orchestration/` (generated by `orchestrator-scaffold`, owned
by this repo). Drive work with:

```bash
uv run orchestrator --project .orchestration <subcommand>
```

See the harness's `USING.md` for the phases and `CHEATSHEET.md` for the commands.
